      ],
      "image": "assets/images/48931/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place sliced onions in the bottom of a Dutch oven or stockpot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t0mT21eeHfYKKC5Faav6SDs3-4I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-48931-Bottom-Round-Roast-with-Onion-Gravy-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-4de68438a22b4b5fbd5d5bd0cd4a3ebf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/48931/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season roast with salt and pepper; place on top of onions. Add vinegar and bay leaf.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yx8jIdVQfZOL4GyP9Z_1Rp3oHiw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-48931-Bottom-Round-Roast-with-Onion-Gravy-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-e64c71c976014310850f2c5fb875b73a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/48931/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat over high heat until simmering. Reduce heat to low, cover the pot, and simmer to desired doneness, 3 to 4 hours. Try not to remove the lid while cooking. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of roast should read 145 degrees F (63 degrees C) for medium doneness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tZB4SHq10TikL3ai0UwZuX-1XeI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-48931-Bottom-Round-Roast-with-Onion-Gravy-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-1c7f84d1b6ef40f8b1f481ab9abd7e5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/48931/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove roast to a serving platter, leaving drippings in the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fkeb5IfO15fTqu09bH3WTNmrh8I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-48931-Bottom-Round-Roast-with-Onion-Gravy-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-a6c4a36a12144595a5192fef90c8ef58.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/48931/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together water and flour in a liquid measuring cup; stir into drippings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
